54	// The kernel is a cross-core pipeline (Cube + Vec) with explicit FIFOs:
55	//   QK (Cube):  compute_qk   -> qk_tile_fifo (fp32)
56	//   P  (Vec):   compute_p    -> p_tile_fifo  (fp16 x_exp) + l1_exp_max_ififo
