61	// - CUBE_S0 / CUBE_S1: tile sizes for QK/PV cube matmuls (compute intensity vs. buffer pressure)
62	// - qkPreloadNum: pipeline warmup depth (more overlap vs. more L1 FIFO footprint)
63	// - *_TNBuffers: ping/pong depth for Mat tiles (overlap) and Vec tiles (latency hiding)
64	// - QKV_CV_FIFO / PV_CV_FIFO: FIFO depth between stages (avoid backpressure)
65	// -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
